  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fostering new SMEs and providing support to existing SMEs, cooperatives and associations involved in the production, storage, and distribution of food, as well as in nutrition- and health-related services (SMEPS) _ ECRP AF2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity adopts a market systems development approach that is fit to the realities of Yemen to strengthen value chains in the target sectors. Support to SMEs under this subcomponent makes use of, and reinforces, market-based mechanisms in order to ensure long-term sustainability. As such, the proposed activities participate to the same ecosystem of support and complement and feed into each other, into a continuum of support approach and a geographic bundle of interventions. Through this act</narrative>
  </description>
